{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50217","headline":"守岁 · 郑愿","name":"守岁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"吾家贵主凤楼开，故岁□更乱箭催。\n愿奉神仙长献酒，请留哥（歌）吹遂（逐）[一]行□。\n（[一]依刘校。\n刘并疑行下所缺当是「盃」字。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑愿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50217.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50217","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}